---

---

<div style="background-color: rgb(var(--color-card), 0.3)">
  <div
    class="my-4 w-full border-y border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 p-6 dark:border-gray-600 dark:bg-gray-800 sm:rounded sm:border-x"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between space-x-4 text-gray-900">
      <p class="text-lg font-bold md:text-xl">The Mediations Private Email List</p>
    </div>
    <p class="pt-3 my-1 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">
      Companion to your life. Join 500+ people in receiving private emails that's meant to fill the newly-born-gap in an AI-first, information overloaded world. I share my experience, not only an information. You can ask questions anytime. Unlike your AI tool, I may say "I don't know."
    </p>
    <p class="pt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      Not published anywhere. Written by hand (literally) without AI. May contain errors.
    </p>
    <form
      class="relative my-5"
      action="https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/candost"
      method="post"
      target="popupwindow"
    >
      <input
        type="email"
        id="bd-email"
        name="email"
        aria-label="Email for Mediations newsletter"
        placeholder="Add your email address here"
        autocomplete="email"
        required="true"
        class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border-gray-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 pr-32 text-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100"
      /><button
        class="absolute right-1 top-1 h-8 w-32 items-center justify-center rounded font-medium"
        style="background-color: rgb(var(--color-primary-yellow)); color: black;"
        type="submit">Let's try it</button
      >
    </form>
    <p class="text-sm">
      No open or click tracking in emails. Not more than once a week. Leave the list anytime.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
